
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-kpat 1.1 --- status: optional

This is the binary version of the kpathsea library which was used to
compile dvips, xdvi and dvi2xx. The current version for this binaries
are 2.1 Note that web2c still uses 1.7! The sources of 1.7 and 2.1 could
be found in the package nts-kpat. You do not need this library for
any program included in NTeX. You shuld just install it if you want to
use it in your own programs. In this case you should also install the
sources for kpathsea.

